# Reproducible dev environment via the flake. Run `direnv allow` once.
#
# Silence direnv's own "export +FOO ..." summary. The flake's shellHook checks
# DIRENV_IN_ENVRC and skips its banner here too, so entering the directory is
# quiet. direnv prints its "loading" line before this file is read, so
# suppressing that one needs DIRENV_LOG_FORMAT set in your shell rc.
export DIRENV_LOG_FORMAT=

use flake

# Load the BODS key into the shell if .env exists. The file is gitignored and
# mode 600; config.py also reads it directly, so this is a convenience for
# ad-hoc curl calls rather than a requirement.
dotenv_if_exists .env
